#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:7
msgid ""
"The DAC outputs analog voltages between 0 V and 3.3 V on one of two STM32 "
"DAC channels."
msgstr ""
"Le DAC produit des tensions analogiques entre 0 V et 3,3 V sur l'un des deux"
" canaux DAC du STM32."

